    ///     a work in progress. While the [[MediaManipulationRatingEnumeration]] list reflects significant community review amongst fact-checkers and others working
    ///     to combat misinformation, the specific structures for representing media objects, their versions and publication context, are still evolving. Similarly, best practices for the relationship between [[MediaReview]] and [[ClaimReview]] markup have not yet been finalized."^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string&gt;</para>
    /// labels<para>"MediaReview"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string&gt;</para></remarks>
