    /// <remarks>
    ///   <para>rdf:Property</para>
    ///   <para>"Represents a relationship between two geometries (or the places they represent), relating a covering geometry to a covered geometry. "Every point of b is a point of (the interior or boundary of) a". As defined in [DE-9IM](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DE-9IM)."^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string&gt;</para>
    /// labels<para>"geoCovers"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string&gt;</para></remarks>
    /// <seealso href="https://schema.org/geoCovers">https://schema.org/geoCovers</seealso>
