    /// <remarks>
    ///   <para>rdf:Property</para>
    ///   <para>"Represents spatial relations in which two geometries (or the places they represent) are topologically disjoint: "they have no point in common. They form a set of disconnected geometries." (A symmetric relationship, as defined in [DE-9IM](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DE-9IM).)"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string&gt;</para>
    /// labels<para>"geoDisjoint"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string&gt;</para></remarks>
