    ///   <para>"Of a [[Person]], and less typically of an [[Organization]], to indicate a known language. We do not distinguish skill levels or reading/writing/speaking/signing here. Use language codes from the [IETF BCP 47 standard](http://tools.ietf.org/html/bcp47)."^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string&gt;</para>
